{"4071090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Town Market Simulator", "steam_appid": 4071090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong><i>Welcome to Tiny Town Market Simulator!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a <strong>miniature toy town</strong> that comes to life inside a magical dome, <strong>Tiny Town Market Simulator</strong> puts you in the shoes of a small merchant determined to grow his own shop into the most beloved market in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a humble stall and transform your business into a thriving success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, raise animals, craft handmade goods, buy upgrades, and manage every corner of your shop in this relaxing yet engaging management simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 <strong><i>Buy, Grow, Craft, Sell, Repeat</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose whether to buy raw materials or produce them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Plant and harvest <strong>fresh crops</strong> to keep your shelves stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Raise animals</strong> to collect milk, eggs, and other valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Use crafting stations to <strong>transform raw ingredients</strong> into profitable goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Manage prices, stock, and customer satisfaction to build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong><i>Expand and Improve</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your profits wisely to unlock new opportunities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Shop Upgrades</strong> – expand, decorate, and attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Farm &amp; Stable Expansions</strong> – grow more crops and raise more animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Crafting Area Improvements</strong> – unlock new recipes and boost production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Warehouse Extensions</strong> – store more goods and optimize your logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong><i>Dynamic Customers &amp; Reputation</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new faces and new challenges.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers quickly, hire employees, keep your shop clean, and watch your <strong>reputation rise</strong> — or face the consequences if your market becomes too chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☀️ <strong><i>A Living World</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunrise to closing time, the rhythm of the day drives your routine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tasks, manage your time, and enjoy the satisfaction of watching your business grow day after day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🌱 Farming, crafting, and trading systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🐮 Animal raising and production chains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🏗️ Deep upgrade trees for shop, farm, crafting area, warehouse, inventory, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 💸 Balanced economy between buying, producing, and selling — choose your own path to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🧍‍♂️ Dynamic customers and procedural reputation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🕒 Day/night cycle and time management gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 📖 In-game mini-wiki with all the information you need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 <strong><i>About the Developer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Town Market Simulator is a passion project developed by <strong>ZimonG</strong> — a solo Italian developer who loves management and simulation games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted project built to grow over time through regular updates and community support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback and participation are essential to shaping the future of Tiny Town Market Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong><i>Join the journey and follow the growth of the most lively market in town!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong><i>Welcome to Tiny Town Market Simulator!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a <strong>miniature toy town</strong> that comes to life inside a magical dome, <strong>Tiny Town Market Simulator</strong> puts you in the shoes of a small merchant determined to grow his own shop into the most beloved market in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a humble stall and transform your business into a thriving success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, raise animals, craft handmade goods, buy upgrades, and manage every corner of your shop in this relaxing yet engaging management simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 <strong><i>Buy, Grow, Craft, Sell, Repeat</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose whether to buy raw materials or produce them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Plant and harvest <strong>fresh crops</strong> to keep your shelves stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Raise animals</strong> to collect milk, eggs, and other valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Use crafting stations to <strong>transform raw ingredients</strong> into profitable goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Manage prices, stock, and customer satisfaction to build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong><i>Expand and Improve</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your pr