n you need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 <strong><i>About the Developer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Town Market Simulator is a passion project developed by <strong>ZimonG</strong> — a solo Italian developer who loves management and simulation games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted project built to grow over time through regular updates and community support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback and participation are essential to shaping the future of Tiny Town Market Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong><i>Join the journey and follow the growth of the most lively market in town!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Manage your own shop in a tiny toy town that comes to life! Grow crops, raise animals, craft handmade goods, and expand your market in this relaxing yet engaging management simulator that keeps evolving over time.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, French, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071090/42d3d91c0c47622ae3a08ae617feb0353ab4aa75/header.jpg?t=1782559040", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071090/d195cfb5d285927dd3f6d0bca1f2554aa2dcb702/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782559040", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071090/d195cfb5d285927dd3f6d0bca1f2554aa2dcb702/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782559040", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li>